WEBVTT

00:00:09.921 --> 00:00:12.793
[ FOOTSTEPS ]

00:00:28.156 --> 00:00:29.941
[ GASPING ]

00:00:29.984 --> 00:00:33.770
[ PANTING ]

00:00:36.991 --> 00:00:38.993
HERMIONE?

00:00:39.037 --> 00:00:41.909
ARE YOU MENTAL?

00:00:41.953 --> 00:00:43.824
IT WAS YOU?

00:00:43.867 --> 00:00:47.175
WELL, YEAH.
BIT OBVIOUS, I'D THINK.

00:00:47.219 --> 00:00:49.699
AND YOU CAST THE DOE AS WELL,
DID YOU?

00:00:49.743 --> 00:00:52.006
NO.
I THOUGHT THAT WAS YOU.

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:54.052
NO, MY PATRONUS IS A STAG.

00:00:54.095 --> 00:00:56.271
RIGHT. YEAH.
ANTLERS.

00:00:58.578 --> 00:01:01.059
Harry: OKAY, RON.

00:01:01.102 --> 00:01:03.452
DO IT.

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:05.454
I CAN'T HANDLE IT.

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:07.326
THAT THING AFFECTS ME MORE THAN
IT AFFECTS YOU AND HERMIONE.

00:01:07.369 --> 00:01:08.805
ALL THE MORE REASON.

00:01:08.849 --> 00:01:10.242
NO.
I CAN'T.

00:01:10.285 --> 00:01:11.939
THEN WHY ARE YOU HERE?

00:01:11.983 --> 00:01:15.334
WHY DID YOU COME BACK?

00:01:22.297 --> 00:01:25.257
NOW, I'LL HAVE TO SPEAK TO IT
IN ORDER FOR IT TO OPEN.

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:27.085
WHEN IT DOES,
DON'T HESITATE.

00:01:27.128 --> 00:01:30.218
I DON'T KNOW WHAT'S IN THERE,
BUT IT'LL PUT UP A FIGHT.

00:01:30.262 --> 00:01:33.134
THE BIT OF RIDDLE THAT WAS
IN THAT DIARY TRIED TO KILL ME.

00:01:33.178 --> 00:01:35.180
[ LOCKET CLICKING ]

00:01:35.223 --> 00:01:37.269
RIGHT.

00:01:37.312 --> 00:01:40.054
ONE...

00:01:40.098 --> 00:01:41.708
TWO...

00:01:41.751 --> 00:01:43.362
THREE.

00:01:43.405 --> 00:01:46.234
[ SPEAKS PARSELTONGUE ]

00:01:47.105 --> 00:01:48.236
[ SCREECHES ]

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:49.846
[ ROARING ]

00:01:53.894 --> 00:01:56.505
[ Echoing ]
I HAVE SEEN YOUR HEART,

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:59.247
AND IT IS MINE.

00:01:59.291 --> 00:02:01.728
[ GASPING ]

00:02:01.771 --> 00:02:05.775
I HAVE SEEN YOUR DREAMS,
RONALD WEASLEY,

00:02:05.819 --> 00:02:08.343
AND I HAVE SEEN YOUR FEARS.

00:02:08.387 --> 00:02:09.649
[ GASPING ]

00:02:09.692 --> 00:02:12.130
LEAST LOVED BY YOUR MOTHER,

00:02:12.173 --> 00:02:14.219
WHO CRAVED A DAUGHTER.

00:02:14.262 --> 00:02:19.876
LEAST LOVED BY THE GIRL
WHO PREFERS YOUR FRIEND.

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:23.358
RON, KILL IT!

00:02:28.711 --> 00:02:31.932
WE WERE BETTER
WITHOUT YOU,

00:02:31.975 --> 00:02:34.108
HAPPIER WITHOUT YOU.

00:02:34.152 --> 00:02:36.458
WHO COULD LOOK AT YOU

00:02:36.502 --> 00:02:40.375
COMPARED TO HARRY POTTER?

00:02:40.419 --> 00:02:44.336
WHAT ARE YOU
COMPARED WITH THE CHOSEN ONE?

00:02:44.379 --> 00:02:46.164
RON, IT'S LYING!

00:02:46.207 --> 00:02:48.775
YOUR MOTHER CONFESSED SHE WOULD
HAVE PREFERRED ME AS A SON.

00:02:48.818 --> 00:02:51.778
WHAT WOMAN WOULD TAKE YOU?

00:02:51.821 --> 00:02:55.173
YOU ARE NOTHING...

00:02:55.216 --> 00:02:56.609
NOTHING...

00:02:56.652 --> 00:03:01.918
NOTHING COMPARED TO HIM.

00:03:01.962 --> 00:03:03.398
[ GASPING ]

00:03:15.367 --> 00:03:17.412
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:03:20.981 --> 00:03:22.243
AAH!

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:54.232
JUST THINK...

00:03:54.275 --> 00:03:56.234
ONLY THREE TO GO.

00:03:59.324 --> 00:04:01.935
Harry: HERMIONE?

00:04:03.241 --> 00:04:05.721
HERMIONE?

00:04:09.508 --> 00:04:11.901
IS EVERYTHING ALL RIGHT?

00:04:11.945 --> 00:04:14.121
IT'S FINE.

00:04:14.165 --> 00:04:17.211
ACTUALLY, YOU KNOW,
IT'S MORE THAN FINE.

00:04:20.214 --> 00:04:24.087
[ Chuckling ] HEY.

00:04:27.308 --> 00:04:29.005
YOU...

00:04:29.049 --> 00:04:31.443
COMPLETE...

00:04:31.486 --> 00:04:33.445
ASS, RONALD WEASLEY!

00:04:33.488 --> 00:04:35.708
YOU SHOW UP HERE AFTER WEEKS,

00:04:35.751 --> 00:04:37.449
AND YOU SAY "HEY"?

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:42.149
WHERE'S MY WAND, HARRY?
WHERE'S MY WAND?I DON'T KNOW.

00:04:42.193 --> 00:04:44.804
HARRY POTTER,
YOU GIVE ME MY WAND!I DON'T HAVE IT!

00:04:44.847 --> 00:04:46.501
HOW COME HE'S GOT
YOUR WAND?

00:04:46.545 --> 00:04:48.416
NEVER MIND
WHY HE'S GOT MY WAND!

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.333
WHAT IS THAT?

00:04:54.422 --> 00:04:58.948
YOU DESTROYED IT.

00:04:58.992 --> 00:05:01.212
AND HOW IS IT
THAT YOU JUST HAPPEN TO HAVE

00:05:01.255 --> 00:05:03.910
THE SWORD
OF GRYFFINDOR?

00:05:03.953 --> 00:05:06.217
IT'S A LONG STORY.

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:11.918
DON'T THINK
THIS CHANGES ANYTHING.

00:05:11.961 --> 00:05:13.311
OH, OF COURSE NOT.

00:05:13.354 --> 00:05:14.834
I ONLY JUST DESTROYED
A BLOODY HORCRUX.

00:05:14.877 --> 00:05:17.271
WHY WOULD THAT
CHANGE ANYTHING?

00:05:17.315 --> 00:05:20.709
LOOK, I WANTED TO COME BACK
AS SOON AS I LEFT.

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:22.494
I JUST DIDN'T KNOW
HOW TO FIND YOU.

00:05:22.537 --> 00:05:23.973
YEAH,
HOW DID YOU FIND US?

00:05:24.017 --> 00:05:25.366
WITH THIS.

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:27.586
IT DOESN'T JUST TURN OFF
LIGHTS.

00:05:27.629 --> 00:05:29.457
I DON'T KNOW
HOW IT WORKS,

00:05:29.501 --> 00:05:30.850
BUT CHRISTMAS MORNING,

00:05:30.893 --> 00:05:33.069
I WAS SLEEPING
IN THIS LITTLE PUB,

00:05:33.113 --> 00:05:35.246
KEEPING AWAY
FROM SOME SNATCHERS.

00:05:35.289 --> 00:05:37.160
AND I HEARD IT.

00:05:37.204 --> 00:05:38.945
"IT"?

00:05:40.338 --> 00:05:43.210
A VOICE --

00:05:43.254 --> 00:05:45.081
YOUR VOICE, HERMIONE --

00:05:45.125 --> 00:05:47.736
COMING OUT OF IT.

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:50.348
AND WHAT EXACTLY DID I SAY,
MAY I ASK?

00:05:50.391 --> 00:05:51.871
MY NAME.

00:05:51.914 --> 00:05:55.178
JUST MY NAME.

00:05:55.222 --> 00:05:58.965
LIKE A WHISPER.

00:05:59.008 --> 00:06:02.403
SO, I TOOK IT,
CLICKED IT,

00:06:02.447 --> 00:06:05.363
AND THIS TINY BALL OF LIGHT
APPEARED.

00:06:05.406 --> 00:06:07.278
AND I KNEW.

00:06:07.321 --> 00:06:10.846
AND SURE ENOUGH,
IT FLOATED TOWARD ME --

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:12.457
THE BALL OF LIGHT.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:17.070
WENT RIGHT TO MY CHEST,
STRAIGHT THROUGH ME.

00:06:17.113 --> 00:06:19.115
RIGHT HERE.

00:06:19.159 --> 00:06:21.422
AND I KNEW IT WAS GONNA TAKE ME
WHERE I NEEDED TO GO,

00:06:21.466 --> 00:06:26.340
SO I DISAPPARATED
AND CAME TO THIS HILLSIDE.

00:06:26.384 --> 00:06:29.474
IT WAS DARK.
I HAD NO IDEA WHERE I WAS.

00:06:29.517 --> 00:06:32.694
I JUST HOPED THAT ONE OF YOU
WOULD SHOW YOURSELF.

00:06:32.738 --> 00:06:34.827
AND YOU DID.

